| ClipTest for !MLT: run by Test when MLTtest$Clip names a video.
Echo 5. Your clip: <MLTtest$Clip>
Echo    its first 10 seconds, made as the preview makes them: VideoCore, then ARM
mltbench <MLTtest$Clip> 250
Set MLT_AVFORMAT_PREFER none
mltbench <MLTtest$Clip> 250
Unset MLT_AVFORMAT_PREFER
Echo    a crossfade of the clip with itself (its first 10 seconds into the next 10, 2 seconds' overlap), as a project
melt <MLTtest$Clip> in=0 out=249 <MLTtest$Clip> in=250 out=499 -mix 50 -mixer luma -consumer xml:/<Wimp$ScrapDir>/MLTtest/clipproject.mlt
mltbench /<Wimp$ScrapDir>/MLTtest/clipproject.mlt
Echo    that project exported (VideoCore)
Echo start <Sys$Time>
melt /<Wimp$ScrapDir>/MLTtest/clipproject.mlt -consumer avformat:/<Wimp$ScrapDir>/MLTtest/clipexport.mp4 vcodec=h264_encvchiq vb=8M acodec=aac
Echo end   <Sys$Time>
FileInfo <Wimp$ScrapDir>.MLTtest.clipexport/mp4
